{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cdd3e76ddaa52a62afa4f72c749f4b22803ad326a51761b5787fbef525b2e7f4", "ja": "瑞希、最近プログラミングに挑戦してるらしいな？", "zh": "瑞希，听说你最近在挑战编程？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "ff580bb3d8d68233bab503bc90ae40b1606f046724cb601e46f975a8ed754a61", "ja": "はい。以前ドラマで、サイバー課の刑事を演じた時に\n興味が。『Hello world』から始めてみました。", "zh": "是的。之前在电视剧里饰演网络科的刑警时，对编程产生了兴趣。我就从“Hello world”开始尝试了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1002_p", "source_sha256": "30b8c7ba819edf89d25ddf01b606cd17fe6d780c13ef4282342a85742eabbb08", "ja": "ハローワールド？\n世界のみんなに挨拶……してるのか？", "zh": "Hello world？\n是在向世界上的大家打招呼……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "ebf89c19b3f36de92842a2c7975bc24e19e6a58599a70d846545865512560b2f", "ja": "こほん。『Hello world』とは、画面に文字を\n表示する初心者向けのプログラミングのことです。", "zh": "咳咳。“Hello world”是指在屏幕上显示文字的入门编程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "a2685a5088568bd5769d4e79463a80e9c3b965d67e02802c15b41147b41fe837", "ja": "学ぶなら、まずは基本から。プログラミングは\nパズルの組み立てに似ていて、とても楽しいです。", "zh": "要学的话，就先从基础开始。编程\n很像拼拼图，非常有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1005_p", "source_sha256": "611f9155e0c75c2908f93743f61a8fccbe960761e6d998607f8a4853d8789d75", "ja": "おお、楽しんでやれてるのはいいことだな。\nいつかは凄腕のプログラマーになれるかもな！", "zh": "哦，能享受其中的乐趣是件好事。说不定将来能成为一名顶尖程序员呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "6da86a18d7b3cf3ffdc581e41715b356c2cddf4aaf1b00732e3a6afc13e66946", "ja": "いいですね。いつかはギーク瑞希のように\n大きなシステムを組み上げてみたい。でもその前に。", "zh": "挺好的呢。我也想有朝一日能像极客瑞希那样，\n构建起庞大的系统。不过在那之前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "cb829e30a3f4c068f07e10a3624b8f6e7da3f3c08ba847fe241b7963ad558a79", "ja": "全人類の夢である、『全自動クロスワードパズル\n生成プログラム』を組み上げるのが、私の目標です。", "zh": "组建出全人类的梦想——“全自动填字游戏生成程序”，就是我的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1cd78d12f9c7de1a805d17038c23a3fcc617bbc8a9d8fe88c03eb5a6d71d5fa2", "ja": "全人類の夢……なのかな？　なんだかすごそうだけど、\n難しそうだし、無理しないようにな？", "zh": "这是全人类的梦想……吗？感觉好像很厉害，但看起来也很难，可别勉强自己啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0332_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0332_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "cac07e643cba394b92c0bc9d329b1d479f617692da984ac3ec25a43d15554f40", "ja": "大丈夫です。疲れた時は、おいしいアセロラジュースで\n頭も心もリフレッシュです。……ぶい。", "zh": "没问题的。累了的时候，就喝美味的针叶樱桃汁\n让头脑和身心都恢复活力。……V。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
